=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4946]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>F/U:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4947]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>6monthly for 2 years</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4948]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Annually for 5 years.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4949]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Guidance regarding self-examination</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4950]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4951]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Imiquimod</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>: </strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4952]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>S/E redness, itching, soreness, </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>fluelike</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> symptoms.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4953]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>same success as surgery @ 6months of use</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4954]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4955]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4956]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4957]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4958]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4959]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4960]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4961]\">\u00a0</p>",
